==Collabs==
Kyoutou Project had a collab with [[Nyanko Daisensou]], adding [[Sakura Sonic (Uber Rare Cat)|Sakura Sonic]] as a Shintou unit; [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], [[Teacher Bun Bun]] as both allies and enemies; and [[Doge]], [[Pigge]] and [[Those Guys]] as opponents only.

