The game also had a collab with the Kyoto International Manga Museum, which added [https://www.kyotomm.jp/en/karasuma/ Miyu Karasuma] - a mascot formed by the connection between the Manga Museum and [[Get On! Kyoto City Subway Collaboration Event|Get on! Kyoto City Subway]] - as a playable character.


